      <h2 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Instructions for Form 1040-X (Rev. December 2025)</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">The Taxpayer Advocate Service (TAS) is here to help you.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">The Taxpayer Advocate Service (TAS) is an independent organization within the Internal Revenue Service (IRS). TAS helps taxpayers resolve problems with the IRS that they cannot resolve on their own. TAS helps taxpayers who are experiencing financial difficulty and who need to ensure that every taxpayer is treated fairly and that you know and understand your rights under the Taxpayer Bill of Rights. We are your voice at the IRS.</p>
